  "system": {
    "slug": "urdnot-wrex",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 12
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Urdnot Wrex is an ancient krogan mercenary, warrior, and battlemaster — one of the most dangerous individuals in the galaxy. A survivor of the genophage, he combines centuries of battlefield experience with powerful biotic abilities. Later, as clan chief, he leads the krogan unification effort. He is equally comfortable negotiating or headbutting his way through a problem.</p><p><strong>Krogan Regeneration:</strong> Wrex recovers 20 HP at the start of each of his turns (even if downed, until dead).</p><p><strong>Biotic Charge (2 actions, 1/encounter):</strong> Wrex charges up to 60 feet in a straight line. He may move through occupied spaces and strikes one target at the end of the charge: +28 melee, 3d8+14 bludgeoning. On a hit the target is knocked Prone.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 70 Shield HP. Recharges 20 HP per turn.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
        "authors": "nscarpinatodev",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true
      },
